  "text": ">\nLocation:\nUltra Dage\nPrice:\nN/A (Reward from the '\nEmpowered BladeMaster\n' quest)\nSellback:\n0 AC\nRarity:\nChampion Rarity\nDescription:\nThis item does 35% more damage to all monsters and gives 25% more gold/exp/rep/cp when equipped. Once in a great while Dage finds a living with the inhuman skill, speed and stealth to serve as a Living BladeMaster.\nNotes:\nAlso see:\nBladeMaster (Class) (0 AC)\n.\nBladeMaster (Class) (AC)\n.\nLiving BladeMaster\n.\nUndead BladeMaster\n.\nMale\nFemale\n+ Normal\n- Normal\n+ Animated\n- Animated\n+ Normal\n- Normal\n+ Animated\n- Animated\n//<![CDATA[\nOZONE.dom.onDomReady(function(){\n        var tabView0e52c50db9bd783cdceefc51c7cece47 = new YAHOO.widget.TabView('wiki-tabview-0e52c50db9bd783cdceefc51c7cece47');\n                }, \"dummy-ondomready-block\");\n        \n//]]>\nThanks to Paradox.\nwindow['nitroAds'].createAd('wad-aqwwiki-below-content', {\n  \"refreshTime\": 30,\n  \"renderVisibleOnly\": false,\n  \"refreshVisibleOnly\": true,\n  \"sizes\": [ [ 300, 250 ] ],\n  \"report\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"wording\": \"Report Ad\",\n    \"position\": \"bottom-right\"\n  }\n  });\n0ac\n_e\nac\nanimated\narmor\ncpboost\ngoldboost\nioda-excl\npseudo-rare\nquestreward\nrepboost\nscarf\nskeletal\nstaffbirthday\nsword\nxdmg2monsters\nxpboost",
